{
  "analysis": "We are at the initial terminal prompt in `/app`. The task requires reading `sequences.fasta`, understanding the desired assembly (input + egfp + flag + snap → output), designing Golden Gate primers with BsaI-HF v2-compatible cut sites, checking melting temperatures with primer3's `oligotm`, and writing `primers.fasta`. We need to first inspect the sequences and available tools.",
  "plan": "Run commands to list the working directory, inspect `sequences.fasta`, and check whether primer3's `oligotm` is installed. This will establish the sequence content and tooling needed for primer design.",
